Space Engineers Damage Scaling Reference:
1 HP = 1 steel plate (damage is measured in HP/steel plates)
Large Grid Heavy Armor Block: 16,500 HP
Large Grid Light Armor Block: 2,500 HP
Damage scaling guidelines:
To destroy 1 heavy armor block: ~16,500 damage
To destroy 1 light armor block: ~2,500 damage
For splash/AOE damage: scale based on radius and desired effect (e.g., 50,000 damage in 7.5m radius can destroy multiple heavy armor blocks with Linear falloff)
Use this when configuring weapon damage values for realistic anti-ship missiles and other weapons.